      "id": "/content/3GEqEecGI45soekezx7Drmt32DA",
      "title": "Self-Improving Robots: An Agent-Orchestrated Platform for Autonomous Skill Development on AWS",
      "description": "This post introduces an AWS platform for self-improving robots. A cloud orchestrator (Amazon Bedrock AgentCore) and edge agent (AWS IoT Greengrass on NVIDIA Jetson) form an autonomous loop: robots execute tasks, record data, get evaluated, retrain on SageMaker, and redeploy — without human intervention. Knowledge distillation compresses a 7B-parameter model into a 500M-parameter edge model with sub-50ms inference. The result: entire robot fleets that continuously improve their skills autonomously.",
      "url": "https://builder.aws.com/content/3GEqEecGI45soekezx7Drmt32DA",
      "imageUrl": "",
      "authorName": "Amir Majlesi",
      "authorAlias": "amajlesi",
